{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"k_Pcuf0G5xgHpEM0ieRt-","x":668,"y":4551,"width":954,"height":327,"type":"text","text":"AI Engineering is the core skill of the FDE role at AI labs and AI-native companies."},
		{"id":"zS0JXpULjSu4SWO741zVp","x":-1625,"y":1749,"width":975,"height":306,"type":"text","text":"DSA is the first gate in FDE interviews. You won't get to show your AI skills if you don't pass this round."},
		{"id":"J-cENDOF6pUjN-wgIs02h","x":-1606,"y":3956,"width":1011,"height":354,"type":"text","text":"A large share of FDE work starts with a data audit. If you can't untangle a customer's schema, you can't build on top of it."},
